# Database Data Verification (QA — olshoperp-docs)

Pakai rule ini saat user / tugas menyebut **cek db**, **query db**, **db staging**, **db tyas**, **db merdian**, **audit trail db**, **verifikasi data di database**, atau saat FAIL E2E perlu bukti baris DB.

## Sumber kebenaran

| Layer | Lokasi | Isi |
|-------|--------|-----|
| **Kontrol QA (workspace ini)** | `tests/DATA-VERIFICATION.md` | Level L1/L2/L3, kapan boleh, matriks env, gate company_id |
| **SoT teknis runner** | `../olshoperp/.cursor/rules/19-database-debugger.mdc` | Read-only, forensik 4 langkah, larangan secret |
| **Runner** | `../olshoperp/scripts/agent-db-query.mjs` | Eksekusi via webhook; kredensial dari `.env` |

Jangan menduplikasi prosedur panjang di sini — baca `tests/DATA-VERIFICATION.md` dulu, lalu rule 19 di `olshoperp` jika forensik mendalam.

## Routing env (ingat)

- **Tyas** (`tyas_olshoperp`) + **Staging** (`staging_olshoperp`) → webhook **shared**
- **Merdian** (`merdian_olshoperp`) → webhook **terpisah** (server beda)

Contoh (path sibling dari root docs):

```bash
node ../olshoperp/scripts/agent-db-query.mjs --db=staging_olshoperp --query="SELECT id FROM products WHERE company_id = 153 LIMIT 5"
```

## Larangan QA (mutlak)

1. Hasil DB **bukan** bukti `last_execution.status: passed` untuk TC UI-crawling.
2. Jangan expose `DB_DEBUG_API_KEY*` / URL override di chat, TC, atau commit.
3. Selalu filter scope **company** yang sedang diuji; SoftDeletes awareness.
4. Read-only saja — jangan usulkan mutasi SQL.
5. Jangan buat folder `qa-docs/{menu}` khusus “cek DB” — tooling ops, bukan fitur menu.

## Triage cepat

| Permintaan | Aksi |
|------------|------|
| Assert TC / flow lulus | Playwright CLI (L1) — rule `14` |
| “Ada gak data X di staging company 153?” | L3 + `--db=staging_olshoperp` |
| “Cek di tyas / merdian” | L3 + flag `--db=` yang sesuai |
| Bug forensik (siapa ubah / soft-delete) | L3 + tabel `audits` (protokol rule 19 olshoperp) |
